    {% if ddci[1] is not none %}{{ t('In the long sector history, a similar brake reduced the worst drawdown by about', '在长期行业历史中，类似的风险刹车使最大回撤降低约') }} <b>{{ ddci[1]|round(1) }} {{ t('percentage points', '个百分点') }}</b>.{% endif %}
    {{ t('It did not improve return per unit of risk enough to make it the default.', '但每单位风险的回报提升不足，因此不设为默认。') }}</p>
